    {
      "block_id": "4f6f7186-adf3-5233-baaa-6b6edc69a25f",
      "content": "内联代码为 $\\texttt { x } = \\texttt { a } + \\texttt { b }$ ，命令为 python -m quality.check --mode=safe。代码中的加号、连字符和等号不得改变。",
